:495:\"Gift Cards for WooCommerce is the official WooCommerce extension for selling prepaid, multi-purpose digital gift cards that customers redeem online. It supports Simple and Variable gift certificates, expiring codes, custom delivery dates, and multiple recipients, and lets store owners track, search, and report on issued, used, and expired codes. Unlike a coupon, it treats gift cards as prepaid balances for accurate accounting. It\'s a paid annual extension with a 30-day money-back guarantee.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:44:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/gift-cards/\";}i:13;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:46:\"products-list-empty-body-gravity-forms-add-ons\";s:7:\"context\";s:24:\"products-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:39:\"woocommerce-gravityforms-product-addons\";s:4:\"icon\";s:102:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/12/Gravity_Forms_Product_Addons_Marketplace_Icon-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"Gravity Forms Product Add-ons\";s:4:\"copy\";s:240:\"Turn Gravity Forms into powerful WooCommerce products. Capture custom data, update pricing in real time, and carry every detail through cart, checkout, and orders. Trusted, proven, and the original Gravity Forms integration for WooCommerce.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:55:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/gravity-forms-add-ons/\";}i:14;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:50:\"products-list-empty-body-wholesale-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:24:\"products-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:29:\"woocommerce-wholesale-pricing\";s:4:\"icon\";s:82:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Wholesale-For-WooCommerce-5.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:43:\"Wholesale For WooCommerce – B2B Ecommerce\";s:4:\"copy\";s:134:\"Run your B2C + B2B eCommerce store with the best AI-Powered WooCommerce B2B plugin for pricing, quotes, bulk orders, and sales agents.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:59:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/wholesale-for-woocommerce/\";}i:15;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:46:\"products-list-empty-body-woocommerce-wishlists\";s:7:\"context\";s:24:\"products-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:21:\"woocommerce-wishlists\";s:4:\"icon\";s:63:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/03/icon-160.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:9:\"Wishlists\";s:4:\"copy\";s:129:\"Wishlists for block and classic themes. Customers and guests save from the shop or product page, or save for later from the cart.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:55:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-wishlists/\";}i:16;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:56:\"products-list-empty-body-quickbooks-sync-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:24:\"products-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:38:\"myworks-woo-sync-for-quickbooks-online\";s:4:\"icon\";s:63:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/qb_thumb.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"QuickBooks Sync\";s:4:\"copy\";s:216:\"The most powerful and customizable integration between WooCommerce and QuickBooks (Online, Desktop, or POS). Forget manual bookkeeping—keep all your sales and inventory data automatically in sync between platforms!\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:65:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/quickbooks-sync-for-woocommerce/\";}i:17;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:42:\"orders-list-empty-body-table-rate-shipping\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:31:\"woocommerce-table-rate-shipping\";s:4:\"icon\";s:101:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/07/Table_Rate_Shipping_icon-marketplace-160x160-2.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:19:\"Table Rate Shipping\";s:4:\"copy\";s:123:\"Advanced, flexible shipping. Define multiple shipping rates based on location, price, weight, shipping class or item count.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:53:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/table-rate-shipping/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:18;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:40:\"orders-list-empty-body-shipment-tracking\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"