ring payments and supports automatic rebilling on failed subscription payments. Subscribers can manage their own plan — upgrading, downgrading, suspending, or canceling — and update their shipping address or payment method. It\'s a paid annual extension with a 30-day money-back guarantee.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:59:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-subscriptions/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:31;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:45:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-composite-products\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:30:\"woocommerce-composite-products\";s:4:\"icon\";s:100:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/Composite_Products_icon-marketplace-160x160-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:18:\"Composite Products\";s:4:\"copy\";s:85:\"Create product kit builders and custom product configurators using existing products.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:52:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/composite-products/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:32;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:50:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-woocommerce-memberships\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:23:\"woocommerce-memberships\";s:4:\"icon\";s:78:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/skyverge-wc-icon-b2vhw6.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:23:\"WooCommerce Memberships\";s:4:\"copy\";s:139:\"Power your membership association, online magazine, elearning sites, and more with access control to content/products and member discounts.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:57:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-memberships/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:33;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:35:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-printful\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:33:\"printful-shipping-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:77:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Printful_Logo_icon_1-1.jpg\";s:5:\"title\";s:25:\"Printful: Print on Demand\";s:4:\"copy\";s:127:\"Sell custom embroidery and print items without inventory or upfront costs. Start or grow your ecommerce business with Printful!\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:42:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/printful/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:34;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:37:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-gift-cards\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:22:\"woocommerce-gift-cards\";s:4:\"icon\";s:92:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Gift_Cards_icon-marketplace-160x160-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:10:\"Gift Cards\";s:4:\"copy\";s:495:\"Gift Cards for WooCommerce is the official WooCommerce extension for selling prepaid, multi-purpose digital gift cards that customers redeem online. It supports Simple and Variable gift certificates, expiring codes, custom delivery dates, and multiple recipients, and lets store owners track, search, and report on issued, used, and expired codes. Unlike a coupon, it treats gift cards as prepaid balances for accurate accounting. It\'s a paid annual extension with a 30-day money-back guarantee.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:44:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/gift-cards/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:35;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:52:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-wholesale-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:29:\"woocommerce-wholesale-pricing\";s:4:\"icon\";s:82:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Wholesale-For-WooCommerce-5.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:41:\"Wholesale For WooCommerce - B2B Ecommerce\";s:4:\"copy\";s:134:\"Run your B2C + B2B eCommerce store with the best AI-Powered WooCommerce B2B plugin for pricing, quotes, bulk orders, and sales agents.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:59:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/wholesale-for-woocommerce/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:36;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:69:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-quantity-discounts-pricing-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:42:\"quantity-discounts-pricing-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:85:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/image_2022_08_12T13_26_36_952Z.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:28:\"Quantity Discounts & Pricing\";s:4:\"copy\";s:112:\"Enable discounts on quantity ranges or set price per quantity for specific products, categories, and user roles.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:76:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/quantity-discounts-pricing-for-woocommerce/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}}s:7:\"updated\";i:1792604319;}',	'off'),
