(22,	1,	'2026-10-13 18:11:03',	'2026-10-13 18:11:03',	'<h2>iPhone 14 Pro</h2>					<h2>Meet the new face</h2>					<h2>Always-On Display. Always at the ready.</h2>		<p>The Apple iPhone 14 combines elegant design, powerful performance, and advanced camera technology for an exceptional everyday experience. Its 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR display delivers vibrant colors and sharp details, while the A15 Bionic chip ensures smooth performance for gaming, multitasking, and everyday apps. Capture stunning photos and videos with its advanced dual-camera system, enjoy all-day battery life, and experience the simplicity of iOS.</p>													<img width=\"380\" height=\"460\" src=\"http://product-store.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-14-pro-2.jpg.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://product-store.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-14-pro-2.jpg.webp 380w, http://product-store.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-14-pro-2.jpg-248x300.webp 248w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 380px) 100vw, 380px\" />																<h2>The Pro Camera System Gets Massively More Pro.</h2>		<p>Experience powerful performance and elegant design with this premium smartphone. Featuring a vibrant 6.1-inch OLED display, an advanced dual-camera system, and a high-performance A15 Bionic chip.</p>													<img width=\"370\" height=\"220\" src=\"http://product-store.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-14-pro-4.jpg.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://product-store.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-14-pro-4.jpg.webp 370w, http://product-store.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-14-pro-4.jpg-300x178.webp 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 370px) 100vw, 370px\" />																<h2>The Picture of Versatility</h2>		<p>Enjoy a seamless smartphone experience with a sleek design, vibrant display, and impressive performance. Capture every moment in stunning detail with advanced camera features.</p>',	'Apple - iPhone 11 - Space Gray (256 GB)',	'• Powerful chip for fast performance, from gaming to multitasking\r\n• Sharp, vivid camera and a bright, smooth display\r\n• All-day battery life with a seamless iOS experience',	'publish',	'open',	'closed',	'',	'apple-iphone-11-space-gray-256-gb',	'',	'',	'2026-10-22 17:51:03',	'2026-10-22 17:51:03',	'',	0,	'http://product-store.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=22',	0,	'product',	'',	0),
